<title>USA: TABLE - R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q2 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.26   profit	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net     profit	  37,676   profit	54,277</p>
<p> Revs		   1,504,997		1,569,114</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 146,432		  154,113</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1996 results include $48.1 million in restructuring charges and $44.2 million gain on sale of Metromail. Excluding these items, Q2 1996 earnings were $0.34 a share.</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.46     loss	 $2.09</p>
<p> Net     profit	  67,016     loss     322,642</p>
<p> Revs		   2,980,235		3,104,526</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 146,076		  154,062</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Six-month 1996 results include $560.6 million in restructuring charges and $44.2 million gain on sale of Metromail. Excluding these items, six-month 1996 earnings were a profit of $0.56 a share.</p>
